  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside the sovereign immortal aperture, Gu Immortals chase contribution points after Fang Yuan sets an exchange list. One human Gu Immortal develops an incomplete transformation path Immortal Gu recipe, hard liver Gu. That Gu Immortal primarily cultivates transformation path. He is Solid Rock Warrior, from Beast Calamity grotto-heaven. Hard liver Gu strengthens the liver and gives lasting energy for laborious tasks without rest, but excessive use hardens the liver to the limit and can trigger a terrifying explosion that inflicts heavy injuries or death. Fang Yuan modifies and completes the recipe, creates rank six to rank eight versions, refines rank eight hard liver Immortal Gu, and uses it as the core of a Gu formation he names liver life formation.",
      "chapters": [
        2135
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_hard_liver_immortal_gu",
        "loc_beast_calamity_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Crazed Demon Cave’s eighth layer, rock monkey Bu Tian Kong fights several rank eight Gu Immortals, including Solid Rock Warrior. Tribulations also hit those Gu Immortals, but they are less targeted than Bu Tian Kong and find a chance to retaliate fiercely, forcing the rock monkey from offense to defense.",
      "chapters": [
        2166
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eighth-layer-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During a later wave of immortal ascension inside the sovereign immortal aperture, narration names Solid Rock Warrior among Gu Masters who ascend in that period.",
